{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 52, :comments ["<b>And if little remains.</b> In a case where the wages for the two good working years that have passed still exceed what is due according to the purchase calculation, he deducts what is due for the years of labor already passed, as the Sages said (Kiddushin 20a): ״נִתְמַעֵט כַּסְפּוֹ כְּפִי שָׁנָיו״ (\"his purchase money diminished according to his years\")."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:38:06.698110115Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}